# Help: this client
%pCommands it answers itself
%Y ?go [arena]    %WChange arena (none named: a public one)
%Y ?namelen x     %WLetters of a name shown in chat
%Y ?lines x       %WLines of chat shown
%Y ?status        %WYour ship, and how you are connected
%Y ?news          %WThe zone's news
%Y ?quit          %WBack to the login screen
%pOn the menu (Esc)
%Y A              %WThe arena list: PgUp, PgDn and Enter
%Y O              %WOptions: keys, sound, screen, macros
%Y F              %WFrame rate and ping
%pIn anything you send
%Y%%Yselfname %%Ytickname %%Ysquad %%Yfreq %%Ybounty %%Yflags
%Y%%Yenergy %%Ykiller %%Ykilled %%Ycoord %%Yredname
%Wbecome what they say: your name, the picked player,
%Wand so on.
